    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάρδεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εων</span>, αἱ, <u>Sardes</u>, the capital of Lydia,
			<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Pers.</u>
			45
		</span></i> (anap.); dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάρδεσι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
			321
		</span></i>:—
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάρδιες</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			7.709
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Alexander</span>), etc. (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάρδῑς</span></b>  is only f.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			5.102
		</span></i>); gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδίων</span>, dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάρδῐσι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.7
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			5.101
		</span></i>, etc.; acc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάοδιας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Dian.</u>
					246
				</span></i>
			, or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάρδῑς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.27
				</span></i>
			:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδιᾱνός</span></b> , 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαργαν-ηνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				630
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				1.172
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηνευς</span> Pap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Σαρδιανοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.2.3
				</span></i>
			:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδιᾱνικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				1174
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				208
			</span></i>; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάπτω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>.</div>
